WEBVTT

00:02.610 --> 00:05.860
URBUS RIGARDEN STADIUM - PLAYER'S DRESSING ROOM
Training, competing,

00:05.860 --> 00:07.360
and mastering.

00:07.950 --> 00:10.110
Then may you be a pillar

00:10.110 --> 00:12.620
URBUS RIGARDEN STADIUM - VIP SEATS
to bear up the sky

00:12.620 --> 00:14.700
and turn away evil.

00:15.910 --> 00:19.420
And with those words from
the founder, Mercedes,

00:22.500 --> 00:26.630
let the Grand Magic Festival begin!

00:30.640 --> 00:32.590
Don't miss a single contest!

00:32.590 --> 00:34.310
SCOUT FROM FIRE FACTION - RODGE HOLLAND
Analyze everything!

00:34.310 --> 00:37.390
There's no telling where we'll find
the next golden egg.

00:37.730 --> 00:38.640
Yes!

01:02.790 --> 01:04.460
6TH-YEAR STUDENT OF THE RIGARDEN MAGICAL ACADEMY
So fast.

01:04.460 --> 01:05.800
PALM SNOCK
Now we know that

01:05.800 --> 01:08.590
Lihanna is going to win the Sky Race.

01:08.590 --> 01:10.800
6TH-YEAR STUDENT OF THE RIGARDEN MAGICAL ACADEMY
That's Miss Perfect for you.

01:10.800 --> 01:11.970
FLIP MALTEAU
No wonder she's at the top of the Academy.

01:11.970 --> 01:13.340
No wonder she's at the top of the Academy.

01:13.340 --> 01:18.310
Huh? Our Earth Princess isn't competing
in the Magecraft this year?

01:20.350 --> 01:26.070
The scouts are already in the stands,
analyzing everything.

01:26.450 --> 01:28.320
The Tower doesn't waste any time.

01:28.320 --> 01:31.820
That's because there are other mages
outside the Tower.

01:31.820 --> 01:35.190
The tug-of-war over
the Academy's promising students

01:35.190 --> 01:36.820
4TH-YEAR STUDENT OF THE RIGARDEN MAGICAL ACADEMY
has already begun.

01:36.820 --> 01:37.580
IRIS CHURCHILL

01:40.750 --> 01:43.790
Miss Perfect's dominance is unbreakable.

01:43.790 --> 01:47.300
She has set a new record time.

01:47.300 --> 01:52.090
She wins the Sky Race for the second year
in a row and reigns as the all-time leader.

01:52.840 --> 01:54.850
Now, if you'll excuse me.

01:55.600 --> 01:57.850
Leaving already?

01:57.850 --> 02:01.380
Yes, I have my own work.

02:03.560 --> 02:04.850
Besides,

02:04.850 --> 02:07.510
there's a senior I'd like to cheer for.

02:10.360 --> 02:13.030
Good luck in Crown Attack, Sion!

02:13.030 --> 02:15.770
We might not have qualified,
but we'll be cheering you on.

02:15.770 --> 02:16.870
Thanks.

02:16.870 --> 02:20.540
Well, I can't turn down a lady's request.

02:23.540 --> 02:25.120
So, Sion...

02:25.510 --> 02:29.460
I hate to ask you this,
but you're the only one.

02:29.460 --> 02:32.760
Would you join our team?

02:33.670 --> 02:38.390
Colette, you finally realized
who you should be spending your time with.

02:38.390 --> 02:42.890
Between me and that flunkee,
of course I'm the obvious choice.

02:44.190 --> 02:47.520
Wait, why is that flunkee doing here?!

02:47.520 --> 02:52.400
Sion, I did ask you
to join our team, didn't I?

02:52.400 --> 02:54.950
To participate in Crown Attack,

02:54.950 --> 02:57.910
COLETTE LOIRE - 7,340 CREDITS
a team needs a total of at least 21,000 credits.

02:57.910 --> 02:59.290
SION ULSTER - 9,889 CREDITS
For Will to be able to participate,

02:59.290 --> 03:00.660
SION ULSTER - 9,889 CREDITS
I need you to join our team.

03:01.240 --> 03:01.580
WILL SERFORT - 5,405 CREDITS

03:01.580 --> 03:03.410
WILL SERFORT - 5,405 CREDITS
Sorry to get you involved.

03:05.370 --> 03:09.130
You must be kidding me!
Why should I have to team up with him?!

03:09.130 --> 03:12.380
Why are you even participating
in a high-level contest anyway?!

03:12.380 --> 03:14.970
Say something, Flunkee!

03:23.930 --> 03:25.770
He's not looking at me.

03:31.400 --> 03:34.240
There was a bit of trouble.

03:34.240 --> 03:38.110
And he says that he has to compete
in Crown Attack against Julius.

03:38.530 --> 03:39.620
He's ignoring me?

03:40.280 --> 03:43.040
After all the humiliation
he gave me before,

03:43.470 --> 03:44.950
yet he didn't even see me?

05:14.130 --> 05:17.380
EPISODE 5: ON YOUR MARKS

05:25.010 --> 05:29.020
And now, it's time to start the afternoon
events of the Grand Magic Festival!

05:29.350 --> 05:31.480
Once again, I'm your host, Mike Maius.

05:31.480 --> 05:33.190
6TH-YEAR STUDENT OF THE RIGARDEN MAGICAL ACADEMY
Once again, I'm your host, Mike Maius.

05:33.190 --> 05:34.520
MIKE MAIUS
And the guest commentator is...

05:34.520 --> 05:37.440
the most hated professor in the Academy.

05:37.440 --> 05:39.400
Insidious and nasty.

05:39.400 --> 05:44.120
Every student dreamed of shoving
their canes into this Dark Viper's ass.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.800
Give me back my credits!
Professor Edward Serfence!

05:45.800 --> 05:47.440
PROFESSOR OF THE RIGARDEN MAGICAL ACADEMY
Professor Edward Serfence!

05:47.440 --> 05:49.040
EDWARD SERFENCE
Professor Edward Serfence!

05:49.040 --> 05:54.670
Whose idea was it to have this
viper commentate beside me?!

05:54.670 --> 05:58.380
Maius, you'd better prepare a coffin
for my next class.

05:58.380 --> 06:01.170
I'm sorry.
Please don't kill me.

06:01.170 --> 06:03.550
Let's continue!

06:03.550 --> 06:07.180
Next, we have today's main event,
Crown Attack.

06:07.530 --> 06:10.930
Please do it, Elf Faction!

06:11.430 --> 06:14.190
Far, far away,
beyond our distant dreams.

06:15.650 --> 06:18.690
O illusion, bring the homeland to us.

06:24.990 --> 06:31.910
Blood whispers, ears listen,
and eyelids depict our noble paradise.

06:34.120 --> 06:36.050
Begin the initiation.

06:38.130 --> 06:39.550
Fairy Order.

06:39.550 --> 06:40.500
Varnica,

06:40.500 --> 06:41.550
Aschenia,

06:41.550 --> 06:42.340
Osis,

06:42.340 --> 06:43.300
Quancia,

06:43.300 --> 06:44.470
Wiche.

06:45.970 --> 06:47.220
Setting the domain.

06:47.760 --> 06:48.800
Open!

06:49.850 --> 06:52.020
Magnaturas Ringul!

07:00.860 --> 07:02.490
The volcano zone.

07:02.490 --> 07:04.320
The marshland zone.

07:04.320 --> 07:06.610
The badlands zone.

07:06.610 --> 07:08.700
The grassland zone.

07:08.700 --> 07:10.370
The woodland zone.

07:10.370 --> 07:15.310
Many areas came from a great spell of
the elves, anything goes with them!

07:16.080 --> 07:19.880
Unlike others, this contest
will be played in teams of three.

07:19.880 --> 07:26.130
Participants will begin outside the area
and make their way to the center of this stadium.

07:26.490 --> 07:32.890
As you can all see, the first team
to reach that crown is the winner.

07:33.310 --> 07:37.350
Of course, they won't be
just going up against nature.

07:37.350 --> 07:42.780
There are a variety of traps from
our professors waiting for them.

07:43.400 --> 07:44.530
You can go straight away to the stadium

07:44.530 --> 07:47.030
ELIZA NOSFERAT - BRUNO MARCUS
You can go straight away to the stadium

07:47.030 --> 07:49.660
or try to block the other teams.

07:49.660 --> 07:53.620
Among the other contests of this festival,
this one is the most wild and heated!

07:53.620 --> 07:56.540
It's truly a battle royale!

07:56.890 --> 08:00.670
How will they work as a team,
dealing with irregularities.

08:00.670 --> 08:04.550
They must approach this as though
it were a real dungeon dive.

08:04.550 --> 08:09.300
Scouts are paying the most attention to this
since all top students will take—

08:09.300 --> 08:10.550
He's right!

08:10.930 --> 08:15.680
This is a high-level contest
where the best students participate.

08:15.680 --> 08:18.480
I shouldn't really be saying this out loud,

08:18.480 --> 08:23.360
but according to the Academy's backroom
gambling, Squad 12 led by Wignall Lindor

08:23.360 --> 08:27.820
and Squad 9 led by Julius Reinberg
are both favorites to win.

08:27.820 --> 08:32.490
And I bet my life savings on Wignall!

08:32.490 --> 08:33.160
What?!

08:33.160 --> 08:34.330
- And then!
- Hey!

08:34.330 --> 08:38.750
There's another team to watch for
a different reason, Squad 6, the least favorite.

08:38.750 --> 08:43.090
Teaming up with favorite, Sion,
none other than the no-talent!

08:44.090 --> 08:48.300
He must be crazy to enter Crown Attack.

08:48.300 --> 08:52.890
Stop embarrassing the Academy, Flunkee!

08:52.890 --> 08:54.220
Will...

08:57.350 --> 09:00.900
The squads for the badlands zone,
be ready!

09:00.900 --> 09:01.600
Yes!

09:07.030 --> 09:07.860
Will?

09:09.030 --> 09:11.110
Are you really entering?

09:11.110 --> 09:14.580
I told you many times to stay away
from this festival!

09:17.290 --> 09:20.000
I'm sorry, Professor Workner.

09:20.870 --> 09:25.000
Even if everyone laughs at me,
I want to win this battle.

09:28.760 --> 09:29.920
Hey!

09:29.920 --> 09:31.160
Will!

09:34.760 --> 09:38.890
Geez. Don't say I didn't warn you!

09:39.350 --> 09:43.190
It's the moment
you've all been waiting for!

09:43.190 --> 09:48.030
Now let Crown Attack...

09:48.860 --> 09:52.360
...begin!

09:55.740 --> 09:58.520
Is that Stone Circle?

09:58.520 --> 09:59.500
No.

10:11.130 --> 10:15.760
As soon as the match starts,
the Golem Thicket is standing in their way!

10:16.510 --> 10:19.770
Numerous Golems are forming
a large wall.

10:20.140 --> 10:22.520
Can they break through?

10:24.140 --> 10:28.150
Wow! Will Serfort of Squad 6
has dashed out!

10:28.150 --> 10:29.940
A suicide attack?

10:29.940 --> 10:31.900
No way a no-talent can beat those.

10:31.900 --> 10:35.490
He couldn't even scratch a golem
during the spellwork exam.

10:35.490 --> 10:37.660
Colette! Counting on you!

10:43.370 --> 10:46.130
Come to me, o droplets of Earth.

10:46.750 --> 10:49.500
Grant me your protection,
o hills of iron!

10:49.500 --> 10:51.590
Loire Sique:

10:52.750 --> 10:54.130
Goltlet!

11:19.450 --> 11:22.540
What was that?!

11:23.370 --> 11:25.410
I knew this was going to happen.

11:27.290 --> 11:29.040
He may not be able to use magic,

11:29.040 --> 11:33.710
but he's not breaking the rules
if he hits them with a magic gauntlet.

11:37.510 --> 11:40.510
I can't believe it!
What a turn of events!

11:40.510 --> 11:43.220
The first one to break through is...

11:43.520 --> 11:48.730
Will Serfort, the Book Learner!

12:32.560 --> 12:37.490
When I was saved by that no-talent,
I was so disgusted that I wanted to die.

12:38.740 --> 12:42.120
That's why I trained so hard
until I felt I could die.

12:42.320 --> 12:45.040
To get as strong as possible.

12:48.870 --> 12:50.920
And yet, he is...

12:52.210 --> 12:54.340
You gotta be kidding me!

12:57.010 --> 13:01.340
Will Serfort is ahead of others!

13:01.340 --> 13:05.350
Crown Attack, where teams are racing
to the stadium to claim the crown.

13:05.350 --> 13:11.980
Squad 6 takes the lead as they step
into the badlands zone!

13:21.610 --> 13:23.530
Will, in front of you!

13:23.530 --> 13:24.370
Yeah!

13:35.420 --> 13:36.500
Colette!

13:38.010 --> 13:40.630
Line up, tombstone of the sword masters.

13:43.720 --> 13:46.680
Loire Sique: Argeorath!

14:31.390 --> 14:34.900
They blew right through the badlands!

14:34.900 --> 14:37.730
They're so fast!

14:37.730 --> 14:41.820
Seriously, what's going on?!

14:41.820 --> 14:44.400
No way, that flunkee...

14:44.820 --> 14:48.660
It's only because Colette
is so good at magic.

14:49.410 --> 14:51.660
That might be a part of it.

14:51.660 --> 14:53.160
So fast.

14:53.160 --> 14:55.790
From spotting the traps
and taking them out...

14:56.750 --> 15:00.050
A movement of a dungeon veteran.

15:00.050 --> 15:06.430
His knowledge and experience allow him
to move with efficiency, almost on reflex.

15:08.180 --> 15:09.640
Senior Will!

15:09.640 --> 15:12.180
You can do it!

15:13.980 --> 15:17.060
Will Serfort of Squad 6 takes the lead!

15:19.310 --> 15:23.570
Shit! We can't afford to fall behind
to someone like no-talent!

15:24.070 --> 15:26.280
Hey! Are you okay?

15:32.830 --> 15:37.040
Each squad is hurrying up,
but the traps are on them without mercy.

15:37.040 --> 15:39.590
This year is also brutal!

15:39.960 --> 15:43.410
Will Serfort's squad
still takes the lead!

15:43.410 --> 15:48.340
Is the no-talent going to
take the first place?!

15:50.180 --> 15:52.310
There's a lot of noise
from the stadium.

15:52.310 --> 15:54.600
Has there been some kind of upset?

15:58.600 --> 16:01.110
Hey, what's going on?

16:02.400 --> 16:07.200
As far as we can tell from our Search,
the no-talent's squad is in the lead.

16:07.200 --> 16:08.990
This is bad, Julius.

16:08.990 --> 16:12.080
If he keeps it up,
the flunkee might actually...

16:13.200 --> 16:15.450
Don't worry.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.540
I'll go.

16:24.460 --> 16:30.470
Squad 6 has reached the final hurdle,
the enchanted woods!

16:37.730 --> 16:39.980
Chain Circle traps?

16:40.400 --> 16:41.730
In that case...

16:46.280 --> 16:48.360
I'll set them all off!

17:02.330 --> 17:04.750
He's refusing to budge!

17:04.750 --> 17:07.210
What are your thoughts?

17:07.210 --> 17:12.140
As the one who set those twisted black
magic landmines, Professor Edward!

17:14.100 --> 17:17.640
Did he just click his tongue?!

17:21.350 --> 17:24.390
In this Crown Attack contest,
the closer you get to the stadium,

17:24.390 --> 17:26.280
the more likely you run
into opposing teams.

17:26.280 --> 17:29.900
Each squad will start going at each other
once they reach the woodland zone.

17:30.740 --> 17:33.410
I'll keep going and wait for an ambush.

17:38.250 --> 17:41.250
As long as I can get the terrain advantage
by the time Julius arrives—

17:51.010 --> 17:52.590
Will, are you okay?

17:53.220 --> 17:55.260
Yeah.

18:01.690 --> 18:05.560
No way!
How did he make it here before us?

18:05.960 --> 18:10.240
He beat Colette and me
in the cast-and-dash race?

18:10.240 --> 18:13.530
Julius is alone?
Are his teammates hiding somewhere?

18:13.530 --> 18:15.570
The one who gets ambushed is us?

18:15.980 --> 18:16.890
Scatter.

18:33.010 --> 18:35.260
Damn it! Change of plans!

18:39.720 --> 18:41.640
I'll face him right here!

18:56.870 --> 19:00.370
O embers, last remnants
of the dead city.

19:00.910 --> 19:02.120
Sion?

19:05.030 --> 19:06.120
Recall it!

19:06.500 --> 19:09.130
The memory of flames
that torment thee!

19:09.670 --> 19:10.630
Remember it!

19:11.170 --> 19:14.090
The flames of the scorched Earth
that extinguished thee!

19:14.090 --> 19:16.510
Now, take the burning grief
for a bygone home.

19:16.510 --> 19:17.800
Will, run!

19:17.800 --> 19:21.770
To burn my foe!

19:25.390 --> 19:28.900
Iflamme Burdelyon!

19:48.580 --> 19:50.710
Where did that shockwave come from?!

19:59.850 --> 20:01.810
What just happened?

20:01.810 --> 20:04.470
Did he just hit me?

20:07.310 --> 20:09.060
The forest...

20:13.860 --> 20:15.780
Get lost, Julius.

20:15.780 --> 20:16.740
You're in my way.

20:18.820 --> 20:20.240
Was he aiming at Julius?

20:20.240 --> 20:23.910
No, he cast it at both Julius and Will.

20:24.740 --> 20:27.000
What were you thinking, Sion?!

20:27.000 --> 20:31.000
I've been a good boy and doing
everything you asked, Colette.

20:31.460 --> 20:34.250
But now, I'm claiming my payment.

20:34.840 --> 20:37.720
Fight me, Flunkee.

20:39.340 --> 20:42.600
What is he talking about?

20:42.600 --> 20:45.640
Here and now? Us?

20:45.640 --> 20:46.890
But why?

20:50.560 --> 20:56.650
You think I need a good reason to beat
an annoying freak like you?!

20:56.650 --> 20:58.650
What is going on?

20:58.650 --> 21:00.400
Stop it, Sion!

21:08.500 --> 21:10.540
Julius?

21:10.540 --> 21:13.420
You're kidding me.
How did he survive that?

21:13.420 --> 21:14.420
Freeze.

21:16.130 --> 21:17.420
Colette!

21:27.890 --> 21:29.640
Sion, stop it!

21:29.640 --> 21:31.600
This is not the time for us
to be fighting!

21:34.400 --> 21:38.110
Hurry up and take the sword,
Flunkee.

23:37.600 --> 23:41.730
Next up, Episode 6 of
Wistoria: Wand and Sword,

23:41.730 --> 23:44.110
"Between Pride and Passion."
